; HCWWALL with Enter at the selection prompt picks points: a closed run of four points makes an outer and an inner outline.
; Found by this harness on 2026-10-07: GetSelection returns Error (not None) for Enter, so this path used to end at once. Fixed in CentreLines.cs.
; EXPECT: Start of wall \(Enter to finish\)
; EXPECT: HCWWALL: 2 wall outline\(s\) on A-WALL, 230 mm thick
; EXPECT: RESULT A-WALL=2 HATCH=1 MEASURE=1
; REJECT: Unknown command "0,0"
(defun cnt (f / s) (if (setq s (ssget "X" f)) (sslength s) 0))
HCWWALL



0,0
4000,0
4000,3000
0,3000
C

(princ (strcat "\nRESULT A-WALL=" (itoa (cnt '((8 . "A-WALL") (0 . "LWPOLYLINE")))) " HATCH=" (itoa (cnt '((0 . "HATCH")))) " MEASURE=" (itoa (cnt '((8 . "MEASURE-LINEAR"))))))
